      "writtenOn": "2023-09-27T07:28:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e However, there\u0027s not a valid case for a key to be generated by an older bootchain then included in a CSR on a newer bootchain. That combo could lead to some interesting attacks..\n\nIn that case, should we consider using CDI_Attest instead? This would ensure that the current boot chain will not generate CSR for keys generated by other bootchains.",
